Licensing review pending for bundled third-party-attributed material.

The original evidence package supplied no license file. This publication does
not grant a blanket open-source license or relicense third-party content.
Existing attribution and applicable rights remain intact. Rights in cited
papers, reports, and third-party-attributed material remain with their
respective rights holders. A public repository is not itself a license grant.

A standard license may be added for clearly owned material after its ownership
and compatibility with existing obligations have been established.
